## Language switcher

A small RU / UZ language switcher has been added to the site header (components/Header.jsx) and is visible on all pages. Behavior:

- Available on all pages: /support, /admin/login, /admin/support, /admin/support/[id], /admin/profile.
- Selected language is stored in localStorage under key `aura_lang`.
- On page load the app reads `aura_lang` (default `ru`) and sets i18n language accordingly.
- Switching language uses i18n.changeLanguage without requiring a page reload and updates UI and toast messages immediately for new events/errors.

Add to PR checklist: ensure language switcher appears and persists selection across reloads.
